						<field>
							<name>P0</name>
							<description>Output Bit 15. This bit determines the level at the output pin Pn.x if the output is        selected as GPIO output. Pn.x can also be set or cleared by control bits of the Pn OMSR  Pn OMCR        or Pn OMR registers.</description>
							<lsb>0</lsb>
							<msb>0</msb>
