						<field>
							<name>FILTDIV</name>
							<description>Digital Glitch Filter Clock Predivider   FILTDIV. This field controls a predivider to generate the digital filter sample clock T filt   T spb   FILTDIV A value of zero in this register disables all glitch filtering.</description>
							<lsb>24</lsb>
