							<description>Backup Clock Monitor Lower Threshold   LOTHR. lower threshold   512  f PLL0   0.9   100 MHz For proper operation and to avoid false alarms  the monitor needs to be disabled via MONEN 0 before changing setting the threshold values.</description>
