							<description>GETH Divider Reload Value   GETHDIV. The resulting GETH frequency is configured to f GETH   xa0    xa0  f source0   xa0    xa0 GETHDIV for the allowed configurations. For GETHDIV  xa0    xa0 0000 B the clock is shut off. f source0 could be configured either to f PLL0  CLKSEL  xa0    xa0 01 B   or f BACK  CLKSEL  xa0    xa0 00 B   GETHDIV must be enabled    0  during an application reset to allow firmware related installation tasks.</description>
							<lsb>0</lsb>
