							<description>IRQ0 Request Status   IRQ0STS. This bit indicates whether a IRQ0 request was serviced or not. This bit        is set by the SMU core after a alarm configured for IRQ0 is detected. This bit can be cleared by writing with   180 1  180  to the CLR bit in the        related AEXCLR register.</description>
