							<description>RST1 Request Status   RST1STS. This bit indicates whether a RST1 request was serviced or not. This bit        is set by the SMU core after a alarm configured for RST1 is detected. This bit can be cleared by writing with   180 1  180  to the CLR bit in the        related AEXCLR register.</description>
							<lsb>4</lsb>
