							<name>RST4STS</name>
							<description>RST4 Request Status   RST4STS. This bit indicates whether a RST4 request was serviced or not. This bit        is set by the SMU core after a alarm configured for RST4 is detected. This bit can be cleared by writing with   180 1  180  to the CLR bit in the        related AEXCLR register.</description>
							<lsb>7</lsb>
