						<field>
							<name>IRQ0AEM</name>
							<description>IRQ0 AEM   IRQ0AEM. This bit indicates that an alarm event is missed. That means that an        alarm has occurred with configuration for IRQ0 Request where this alarm        handler was blocked because of AEX.IRQ0STS. This bit can be cleared by writing with   180 1  180  to the CLR bit in the        related AEXCLR register.</description>
