							<description>Capture Compare State Bits for CC62  x   0  1  2    CC62ST. Bits CC6xST monitor the state of the capture compare channels. Bits        CC6xST  x  160    160 0  1  2  are related to T12 and are set and cleared        according to the T12 switching rules.</description>
