							<name>RST</name>
							<description>Kernel Reset   RST. This reset bit can be used to request for a kernel reset. The kernel reset will be executed if the reset bits of both kernel reset registers is set. The RST bit will be cleared  re set to  0   by the BPI after the kernel reset was executed.</description>
