							<description>Kernel Reset Status   RSTSTAT. This bit indicates wether a kernel reset was executed or not. This bit        is set after the execution of a kernel reset in the same clock cycle in        which the reset bits are cleared. This bit can be cleared by writing with   180 1  180  to the CLR bit in the        related KRSTCLR register.</description>
							<lsb>1</lsb>
							<msb>1</msb>
							<access>read-only</access>
						</field>
