						<fields>
							<field>
								<name>EN_CLK0</name>
								<description>Enable clock source x. Any read access to an EN CLK x    EN ECLK z  or EN FXCLK bit field will always result in        a value 00 or 11 indicating current state. A modification of the state        is only performed with the values 01 and 10. Writing the values 00 and        11 is always ignored. Any disabling to EN CLK x  will be reset        internal counters for configurable clocks.</description>
								<lsb>0</lsb>
								<msb>1</msb>
								<access>read-write</access>
							</field>
							<field>
								<name>EN_CLK1</name>
