								<name>ENDIS_STAT5</name>
								<description>TOM channel 7 enable disable update value. If FREEZE   0  If a TOM channel is disabled  the counter CN0 is stopped and the output        register of SOU unit is set to the inverse value of control bit SL. On        an enable event  the counter CN0 starts counting from its current value. If FREEZE   1  If a TOM channel is disabled  the counter CN0 is stopped. On an enable        event  the counter CN0 starts counting from its current value. Write of following double bit values is possible </description>
