									<name>STR4_CONF</name>
									<description>Reconfiguration of stream 4 to FIFO channel 0. Write of following double bit values is possible  The write protected bits of register F2A i  CTRL are only writable if the corresponding enable bit STR0 EN and STR4 EN of        register F2A ENABLE is cleared.</description>
