									<description>Reconfiguration of stream 7 to FIFO channel 3. Write of following double bit values is possible  The write protected bits of register F2A i  CTRL are only writable if the corresponding enable bit STR3 EN and STR7 EN of        register F2A ENABLE is cleared.</description>
