							<field>
								<name>ID_PMTR_X</name>
								<description>ID information to the input signal PMTR z  from the ARU. This value can only be written when the action  z  is disabled by the        correspondent bit AENz 0 of the registers DPLL CTRL 2  ...5         respectively  or when the DPLL is disabled  DEN 0 .</description>
								<lsb>0</lsb>
