 resetvalue={PowerOn Reset:0x0,DPLL_RAM_INI.INIT_1BC:0x0}</description>
						<addressOffset>1472</addressOffset>
						<size>32</size>
						<resetValue>0</resetValue>
						<resetMask>0</resetMask>
						<fields>
							<field>
								<name>MLS1</name>
								<description>Number of pulses between two STATE events. For SMC 0 the value of MLS1 is calculated once by the CPU for fixed        values in the DPLL CTRL 0 register by the formula MLS1            MLT 1   TNU 1   SNU 1   and set accordingly. For SMC 1 the value of MLS1 represents the number of pulses between two        nominal TRIGGER events  to be set and        updated by the CPU .</description>
								<lsb>0</lsb>
								<msb>17</msb>
								<access>read-write</access>
							</field>
						</fields>
