								<description>Physical deviation of STATE. Adapt values for each STATE increment in        FULL SCALE  sint16   This value represents the number of pulses to be added to the        correspondent nominal increment. The absolute value of a negative PD S        must not exceed MLS1 or MLS2 respectively. The PD value does mean the        number of SUB INC1 pulses per nominal tooth to be added to        NS   MLS1 2 1    PD S  </description>
								<lsb>0</lsb>
