								<description>Reset source of CCU0. If RST CCU0 1 and UPEN CTRLx 1 are set  TRIG  x 1  or TIM  EXT CAPTURE x  triggers        also the update of work register  CM0  CM1 and CLK SRC .</description>
								<lsb>20</lsb>
								<msb>20</msb>
								<access>read-write</access>
							</field>
							<field>
								<name>OSM_TRIG</name>
								<description>Enable trigger of one shot pulse by trigger signal OSM TRIG. This bit should only be set if bit OSM 1 and bit RST CCU0 0.</description>
								<lsb>21</lsb>
								<msb>21</msb>
								<access>read-write</access>
