								<description>ATOM channel 7 enable disable update value. If FREEZE 0 and an ATOM channel is disabled  the counter CN0 is stopped and the output register of SOU unit is set to the       inverse value of control bit SL. On an enable event  the counter CN0 starts counting from its current value. If FREEZE 1 and an ATOM channel is disabled  the counter CN0 is       stopped  SOMP  SOMS mode  and each comparison is stopped  SOMC  SOMB mode . On an enable       event  the counter CN0 starts counting from its current value or a comparison is restarted. Write of following double bit values is possible  Note  If the output is disabled  OUTEN x  0   the ATOM channel x output ATOM OUT x  is the inverted value of bit SL.</description>
