								<description>Current Program Counter. Note  The program counter is only writable if the corresponding MCS channel is disabled. The bits 0 and 1 are always written as zeros. Note  The actual width of the program counter depends on the MCS configuration. The actual width is RAW USR 2 bits meaning that only the bits 0 to RAW USR 1 are available and the other bits  RAW USR 2 to 31  are reserved.</description>
