						<field>
							<name>AEIM_CLUSTER</name>
							<description>AEIM cluster number. These bits show the number of the AEI master port cluster which throws        the interrupts AEIM USP ADDR         AEIM IM ADDR and AEIM USP BE depending on the AEI master port access status.Note  If one        of the corresponding irq notify bits  6 4  is set  this bit field will        be frozen until the interrupt notify bits  6 4  are cleared.</description>
