							<name>RST</name>
							<description>Kernel Reset. This reset bit can be used to request for a kernel reset. The kernel        reset will be executed if the reset bits of both kernel registers are        set. The RST bit will be cleared  re set to   180 0  180   by the BPI FPI after the        kernel reset was executed.</description>
