							<description>Kernel Reset Status. This bit indicates whether a kernel reset was executed or not. This bit        is set by the BPI FPI after the execution of a kernel reset in the same        clock cycle both reset bits. This bit can be cleared by writing with   180 1  180  to the CLR bit in the        related RESET CLR register.</description>
							<lsb>1</lsb>
							<msb>1</msb>
							<access>read-only</access>
