							<description>Step Down Converter Core Voltage Feedback ADC Conversion Result   ADCFBCV. This bit field indicates the last ADC conversion result of the step down converter feedback ADC measuring VDD core voltage. VIN  xa0    xa0  LSB  xa0    xa0  ADCFBCV  xa0    xa0 EVRTRIM.SDVOUTTRIM    0.7125   xa0 V  xa0    xa0 LSB   5  xa0 mV E.g. 1.20  xa0 V   62   98</description>
