							<description>RxIPv6 Payload Octets   RXIPV6NOPAYOCT. This field indicates the number of bytes received in IPv6 datagrams that did not have a TCP  UDP  or ICMP payload. The value in the Length field of IPv6 header is used to update this counter.  Ethernet header  FCS  pad  or IP pad bytes are not included in this counter. Value After Reset  0x0</description>
