									<name>F0AI</name>
									<description>Rx FIFO 0 Acknowledge Index   F0AI. After the Host has read a message or a sequence of messages from Rx FIFO 0 it has to write the buffer index of the last element read from Rx FIFO 0 to F0AI. This will set the Rx FIFO 0 Get Index RXF0S.F0GI to F0AI   1 and update the FIFO 0 Fill Level RXF0S.F0FL.</description>
									<lsb>0</lsb>
