						<field>
							<name>RST</name>
							<description>Kernel Reset   RST. This reset bit can be used to request for a kernel reset. The kernel reset will be executed if the reset bits of both kernel reset registers is set. The RST bit will be cleared  reset to  0   by the BPI FPI after the kernel reset was executed.</description>
							<lsb>0</lsb>
							<msb>0</msb>
							<access>read-write</access>
