							<field>
								<name>MSG0</name>
								<description>Messaging Bits   MSG5. If set  the 2 Messaging bits are configured for the PSI5 channel x in slot y. If set  Enhanced Serial Message processing on bits D 1 0  is activated.  18 frames  4 or 8 bit ID  12 or 16 bit data  6 bit CRC  If Messaging bits are transmitted they are always presented in RDRx independently from status of MSGy. I.e. RDRx always stores exactly the data that was received.</description>
								<lsb>0</lsb>
								<msb>0</msb>
								<access>read-write</access>
							</field>
