							<description>External Time Stamp Clear Source Select   ECS. Selects the external trigger line that clears the global Time Stamp        Counters TSCNTA B.CTS if this is enabled by ECEA ECEB.</description>
							<lsb>26</lsb>
							<msb>28</msb>
							<access>read-write</access>
