							<name>ECEA</name>
							<description>External Time Stamp Clear Enable A   ECEA. Enables the external trigger line selected by ECS to clear the global Time Stamp Counter TSCNTA.CTS on rising edge of the external trigger.</description>
							<lsb>29</lsb>
							<msb>29</msb>
							<access>read-write</access>
